ka, nijaa jeekatsiri inkiteki!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Pajahaa-wentee-yaawo iwaero Tajorentsi,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tema apatziro iñaawaetaki rirori, wetsika-yitanakimi eeroka-paeni.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cpy_wbt/PSA/148.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cpy_wbt/PSA/149.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cpy_wbt/PSA/147.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}